senses.gloss:
अलङ्-करिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, fond of ornament;
decorating, skilled in decorating; ornamented; (उस्),
m. an epithet of Śiva.

अलय अ-लय, अस्, m. (rt. ली, to be dissolved,
or to rest, cling to), non-dissolution, permanence;
(अस्, आ, अम्), houseless, homeless; vagrant.

आ-लम्भ, अस्, m. taking hold of, seizing, touching;
tearing off, rooting out (of plants); the killing of the
animal at a sacrifice.
